WEBVTT

01:02:23.996 --> 01:02:30.829
And idea and by force of will to make
it happen in the world and in

01:02:30.829 --> 01:02:36.788
an incentive system that rewards you
for making the most impact on

01:02:36.788 --> 01:02:40.121
the most people like in our system.

01:02:40.163 --> 01:02:44.038
That's how we get most of the
things that that we use.

01:02:44.038 --> 01:02:46.496
That's how we got the computer
that I'm using,

01:02:46.496 --> 01:02:48.871
the software I'm using
to talk to you on it.

01:02:49.413 --> 01:02:53.079
Like all of this, you know, everyone in
life, everything has a balance sheet.

01:02:53.079 --> 01:02:55.121
There's plenty of very annoying
things about them.

01:02:55.121 --> 01:02:57.121
And there's plenty of very
annoying things about

01:02:57.121 --> 01:02:59.871
the system that sort of idolizes them.